{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐细节和感受的层次变化不如X丰富，尤其缺少随具体乐句出现的细微起伏提示，部分音乐情绪被概括得比较快。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更像一个普通观众能边听边读懂的完整故事：每段话交代清楚发生了什么、他为什么这样想、前后情绪如何变化，右侧感受也能帮助观众迅速进入情境。X的音乐感受更细密，特别是乐句的起伏、音色和身体感受有更具体的描绘，但短词过多、意象切换频繁，容易让观众忙于接收碎片而错过人物主线。综合实际观看体验，我会选Y，同时认为X在音乐感受的精细程度上有值得保留的优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1bdc94be-388f-477a-ac59-676d040077bb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T090224190501Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:03:35.866323+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9c501f29b1e39ceb1a74350c1109ef2da20cfd71cccf135011310e0b75c126ce", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3